{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>藝人陳詩欣2021年與拍拖多年圈外男友結婚，去年誕下兒子，經常分享闊太生活的她，近日一家三口便去了沖繩旅行，賀老公生日，陳詩欣晒出身穿比堅尼Top配短褲騷Quali，興奮留言：「Hi Okinawa，帶寶寶去旅行，午睡時間就是媽媽的me time。」，雖然身材甚Fit，但她爆被另一半嫌肥，貪玩的她來個大反擊，就是Po出另一半的水着照，侃調：「佢成日話我肥啊！作死！你先肥啊！」</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T10:39:29.595457+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T10:01:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T15:33:12.470457+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T10:33:05.050470+00:00","content_hash":"959c6a4b3c196b2bef416b4559e47708304c9b94f2fbb82e5dca90b440161c26","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T10:39:29.595457+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}